\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {The whole paper.} \textbf  {(a)}~The four layers as a funnel over the 31 cells carrying a selection-split gate: seven clear $V_{\text  {ridge}}{\geq }0.20$; CKA is measured on all 31 and filters none (dashed box); the fine-tune-versus-frozen comparison is scored on held-out windows, on which 4 of the 31 reverse sign; and \emph  {none} satisfies the three-clause degradation definition of \S  \ref {sec:method}, four of the seven survivors being \emph  {improved} by full fine-tuning in every seed. \textbf  {(b)}~The same 31 cells as CKA against held-out $\Delta _\text  {enc}$ (positive ${=}$ freezing better): \textbf  {measured drift does not reliably predict the value of encoder adaptation}. No cut on CKA separates the cells adaptation helped from the cells it hurt---the best threshold misplaces five of the 31---and the labelled pairs are the running example above. Within Moirai, the only backbone with enough cells to ask, neither CKA ($\rho {=}{+}0.17$, clustered CI $[-0.47,{+}0.72]$) nor the gate score ($\rho {=}{-}0.29$, $[-0.71,{+}0.71]$) orders $\Delta _\text  {enc}$; both span zero (Appendix~\ref {app:clustered}). Filled markers clear the gate.}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:screen}{{1}{2}{\textbf {The whole paper.} \textbf {(a)}~The four layers as a funnel over the 31 cells carrying a selection-split gate: seven clear $\Vb {\text {ridge}}{\geq }0.20$; CKA is measured on all 31 and filters none (dashed box); the fine-tune-versus-frozen comparison is scored on held-out windows, on which 4 of the 31 reverse sign; and \emph {none} satisfies the three-clause degradation definition of \S \ref {sec:method}, four of the seven survivors being \emph {improved} by full fine-tuning in every seed. \textbf {(b)}~The same 31 cells as CKA against held-out $\denc $ (positive ${=}$ freezing better): \textbf {measured drift does not reliably predict the value of encoder adaptation}. No cut on CKA separates the cells adaptation helped from the cells it hurt---the best threshold misplaces five of the 31---and the labelled pairs are the running example above. Within Moirai, the only backbone with enough cells to ask, neither CKA ($\rho {=}{+}0.17$, clustered CI $[-0.47,{+}0.72]$) nor the gate score ($\rho {=}{-}0.29$, $[-0.71,{+}0.71]$) orders $\denc $; both span zero (Appendix~\ref {app:clustered}). Filled markers clear the gate}{figure.caption.1}{}}
